      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Here's  my fork of lemonpie  using   the OG version of DEV-C3   10.31.2023   .  The drive  is magnificent been testing for almost 2 months now. This is for folks  who prioritize lateral over long ( im on chill mode -Accord)        ` mv openpilot op_backup_$(date +%Y%m%d%H%M%S) && git clone --single-branch https://github.com/eyezenheim/sunnypilot openpilot -b dev-c3-lemonpie && sudo systemctl restart comma`        this has a locked steer ratio of 19.33 ( Accord)  other car make and model please do a    `cat /data/params/d/LiveParameters`  to find out your learned SteerRatio then plug it in    /data/selfdrive/car/yourcarmake/interface.py   See my YT channel to see it in action  ENJOY! https://youtu.be/QSEN_RvOY0Q",
